# basePath Chapter5

::FirstContractOpenCh5 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      Captain, I have another suprise for you! 
{@Player}   Another crew-mate, wait... finally someone else on the ship??
{@PAL}      No! 
{@Player}   Oh.
{@PAL}      Instead of one contract, you now have... two!
{@PAL}      Congratulations on achieving agency Captain! 
{@Player}   ...thanks P.A.L. 
{@PAL}      One that is simple, the other contract is a bit more complex. 
{@PAL}      They also have different contractors. One is an independent contract, the other is a Frontier contract. 
{@PAL}      You decide, but remember, Frontier Robotics is your best friend! 
{@Player}   Right. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh5
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Ovill}    Hi Locke.
{@Ovill}    I got a thrilling new update for the Forsch Sector!
{@Ovill}    As you may know the Ausrine System has been dealing with some pesky pirates, specifically when sourcing Boron. 
{@Ovill}    We at Frontier Robotics have officially established a Boron system. 
{@Ovill}    It is advised that all Frontier Robotics ships source from this new location. 
{@Callie}   Oil spit! Lies I hear. 
{@Ovill}    How-how did you get this frequency?! This is an encrypted channel? 
{@Callie}   Frontier? Having proper firewall protections? 
{@Player}   

